{"version":1,"content":"<p>記者17日從中國科學院空天信息創新研究院（以下簡稱「空天院」）獲悉，該院聯合國內多家單位，在中國遙感衞星地面站麗江站成功實現Q/V頻段最高碼速率無線通信實驗驗證。此次實驗雙向傳輸速率高達27Gbps，刷新國內同頻段紀錄，關鍵指標達到國內領先、國際先進水平。相關成果將為我國6G通信與衞星互聯網技術發展提供核心技術支撐。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586770.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T07:10:00.191018+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:48:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T07:03:14.761637+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T07:03:14.761637+00:00","content_hash":"5eaefaed0bcd486e9d666f71bceec4f27203ee5f4b7b91b7f05d547dfc91ca37","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}